exec chainlink keys Ton --help
cmp stdout out.txt

-- out.txt --
NAME:
   chainlink keys Ton - Remote commands for administering the node's Ton keys

USAGE:
   chainlink keys Ton command [command options] [arguments...]

COMMANDS:
   create  Create a Ton key
   import  Import Ton key from keyfile
   export  Export Ton key to keyfile
   delete  Delete Ton key if present
   list    List the Ton keys

OPTIONS:
   --help, -h  show help
   
